flowchart TD
  L[Layout: words + vector fills per page] --> SW[Find swatches: small square fills with a label to the right]
  SW --> LG[Legend entries: label, RGB, page region]
  L --> GR[Find 'Month YYYY' header + 7 weekday labels]
  GR --> CE[Cell rectangles: modal size filled rects]
  CE --> DT[Date = week start + row/col; check printed day number]
  DT -->|mismatch| WARN[Report grid_misaligned; skip cell; never shift date]
  DT -->|match| CS[Cell colour + cell text]
  CS --> BL{Blank / white?}
  BL -->|yes| NC[No colour evidence]
  BL -->|no| M[CIE76 Delta E to every legend colour]
  LG --> M
  M -->|best <= tolerance| MT[Matched entry; ambiguous if runner-up within 3 dE]
  M -->|none within tolerance| UM[Unlisted colour]
  MT --> CL[Classify: text rules vs legend wording]
  NC --> CL
  UM --> CL
  CL -->|text and legend agree| OK[confirmed]
  CL -->|only one source explicit| OK2[confirmed / inferred]
  CL -->|text contradicts legend| AM[ambiguous + critical warning]
  CL -->|half day, no printed time| NR[needs_review: no assumed time]
  CL -->|colour only, no text or no legend match| AM2[ambiguous / needs_review: untitled placeholder]
  OK --> MG[Merge consecutive same-colour days into one event]
  OK2 --> MG
